OL,3,AUK ticket holder wins #111m
OL,4,AEuroMillions jackpot
OL,5,
OL,6,FA UK ticket holder has won Friday's
OL,7,F#111m EuroMillions jackpot, National
OL,8,FLottery operator Allwyn has confirmed.
OL,10,FOne mystery player matched all five
OL,11,Fnumbers ` 11, 12, 15, 38, 49 ` plus the
OL,12,Ftwo Lucky Star numbers ` 10 and 12 ` to
OL,13,Fscoop the major prize.
OL,15,FAllwyn's senior winners' adviser Andy
OL,16,FCarter said it was "fantastic news for
OL,17,Fa UK EuroMillions player" who has
OL,18,Fsecured the "life-changing" sum.
OL,20,FIt marks the third time a UK winner has
OL,21,Fclaimed the jackpot this year.
